{
  "id": "frontend_developer",
  "name": "前端工程师",
  "description": "Web 前端、浏览器调试与 Node 生态",
  "readme": "# 前端工程师 · 新人必读\n\n## 必装逻辑\nNode 运行时 + 现代编辑器 + 浏览器调试三件套。\n\n## 上手顺序\n1. Homebrew → Git → Node / nvm。\n2. VS Code 或 Cursor。\n3. Chrome / Firefox 与 API 调试（Postman 等）。\n4. 可选：Docker、Figma、终端增强（starship / fzf）。\n\n## 常见坑\n- nvm 与系统 Node 冲突时，以项目 `.nvmrc` 为准。\n- 公司私有源需另行配置 npm registry。\n",
  "icon": "globe",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "includes": [
    "_base_office"
  ],
  "tools": [
    {
      "ref": "visual-studio-code",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "cursor",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "google-chrome",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "firefox",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "node",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "nvm",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "docker",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "postman",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "figma",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "starship",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "fzf",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "ref": "ripgrep",
      "required": false
    }
  ],
  "postInstall": [
    {
      "id": "omz",
      "name": "Oh My Zsh",
      "script": "install_omz.sh",
      "skipIf": "test -d \"$HOME/.oh-my-zsh\""
    },
    {
      "id": "zsh-plugins",
      "name": "Zsh 插件",
      "script": "configure_zsh_plugins.sh",
      "skipIf": "test -d \"$HOME/.oh-my-zsh/custom/plugins/zsh-autosuggestions\""
    }
  ]
}
